WEBVTT

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:04.795
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> So, your sister is visiting from the US?

00:00:05.503 --> 00:00:08.052
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah… she’s going to meet Izzy this evening.

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:10.053
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Are you nervous?

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.783
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Hello, this is room thirteen.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.270
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> How can I help you?

00:00:14.899 --> 00:00:16.836
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> There’s a problem with the air conditioning.

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:20.095
It isn’t working and it’s very hot in my room.

00:00:21.008 --> 00:00:23.217
Ben, Izzy can’t come with us.

00:00:23.218 --> 00:00:25.699
She needs to meet some people from work.

00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:27.969
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Really, Izzy?

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:31.628
Do you really need to go to this work thing?

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.256
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Actually, I need to go now.

00:01:26.188 --> 00:01:26.969
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Morning!

00:01:27.891 --> 00:01:28.547
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Morning.

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:30.364
Turn off the light!

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:33.120
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think I left my phone charger here!

00:01:33.599 --> 00:01:34.037
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:35.516
It’s there.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.656
What time is it?

00:01:38.078 --> 00:01:39.708
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> It’s ten past seven.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.047
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> You’re up early today.

00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:44.308
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Actually, I’m late.

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:48.964
Don’t forget we’re having dinner with some people from work this evening.

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:49.969
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I know.

00:01:51.323 --> 00:01:52.792
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do you remember where it is?

00:01:53.542 --> 00:01:55.860
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Les Amis, seven p.m.

00:01:56.323 --> 00:01:57.193
Get there early.

00:01:57.594 --> 00:01:58.292
Dress nicely.

00:01:59.682 --> 00:02:00.885
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks for coming this evening.

00:02:01.453 --> 00:02:02.320
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No problem.

00:02:03.177 --> 00:02:06.708
Now… I’m going to go back to sleep.

00:02:07.474 --> 00:02:09.641
My first class isn’t until ten today.

00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:16.099
Hey! Where’s your helmet?

00:02:16.938 --> 00:02:17.688
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I don’t need it.

00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:19.396
I’m getting a taxi today.

00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:22.979
I’m meeting an important client and I can’t be late.